<h2>Eclipse Napa on the Wine Wall</h2>

<p>The opposite wall flips brands: <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse</a> in the <strong>Napa</strong> door style, with the same Yosemite Brown finish carrying over. Napa is a cleaner, stile-and-rail shaker — slightly more contemporary than the beaded inset across the room, and a great fit for the wine display: open floating shelves with under-mount LEDs, stem rails, marble back, and a flush-mount double oven tucked into a tall column on the right.</p>

<p>The reason this matters: a homeowner who walks in already shopping Eclipse can see Eclipse in this finish. A homeowner who walks in shopping Shiloh can see Shiloh. And a homeowner who hasn't picked yet can compare both — same finish, different door styles, in the same room. That's a closing showroom.</p>

